This still reproduces on current main. In `ToolNode`'s output combining, parent commands with `goto=[Send...]` are merged into `Command(graph=PARENT, goto=...)`, and each tool's `update` is dropped.

Proposed fix: keep merging `goto`, and also carry each tool's `update` (merged into the parent command, or emitted as separate parent `Command`s so reducers apply). I'll add a regression test with two tools returning `Command.PARENT` + `Send`.

